      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: 'There it is...the Well!

        I thought it''d be a bit more impressive'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: You'll see. Things aren't going to be easy from here. This...this is
        going to hurt
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: We've come this far, how bad could one little well be?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: No other way to see than to jump in and find out
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
